   "title": "Start here",
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Krea 2 - Single image\n\n1. Write your prompt in **Prompt** (stage 1).\n2. **Run**. The image is saved to `ComfyUI/output/krea2/`.\n\nOptional: enable **Style LoRA** (right-click > Bypass) after downloading the style LoRAs (`DOWNLOAD_STYLE_LORAS=1` at deploy). Each has a trigger word, listed in its note.\n\n**Red nodes are the ones you set.** Stages run left to right with a note under each.\n\nFull instructions: https://github.com/tenitsky/krea2-image"
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
